  "algebra": "failure = actor x object x boundary x state x time x evidence x authority x dependency x environment x action x consequence",
  "hard_rules": [
    "UNCLASSIFIED never passes",
    "UNKNOWN never passes",
    "novel conditions require quarantine and forensic classification",
    "evidence never grants authority",
    "verification never equals certification",
    "certification never equals merge",
    "merge never equals completion",
    "main SHA change invalidates dependent evidence unless explicitly rebound and reverified",
    "independent evidence must not share a hidden common failure source",
    "self-attestation is not independent verification",
    "retries without new evidence are bounded and cannot manufacture confidence",
    "assurance controls cannot weaken the constitution through autonomous execution"
